Taxonomy Sparx QEA read plugin

Selected Enterprise Architect table and implicit-reference mapping rules were
informed by AAroN (https://github.com/schmitze87/AAroN), commit
490c8538c6bf94bd78a9c90cc53c0163f23dd1a4, distributed under Apache License 2.0.
Credit is retained for the AAroN authors and contributors. See the accompanying
LICENSE. No AAroN binary or Neo4j implementation is included.

The Taxonomy implementation uses its own bounded SQLite reader and exchange
contracts. Changes include deterministic reference IDs, explicit losses,
reviewed-selection validation and distinct package/diagram placements.
